    {% if is_reading_stand %}
    <div class="premium-packaging">
      <div>
        <p class="premium-eyebrow"><span></span> UN OBJETO, MUCHAS POSIBILIDADES</p>
        <h2>De la biblioteca<br>al escritorio.</h2>
        <p>Para leer una novela, estudiar, consultar una receta o trabajar desde casa. Un solo soporte que se adapta a tus espacios y a tu rutina.</p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Lectura manos libres</li>
        <li>Ángulo ajustable</li>
        <li>Se pliega para guardar</li>
        <li>340 × 235 × 76 mm</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <section class="premium-trust" aria-label="Información de compra">
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><p><strong>60 días de garantía</strong><small>Te acompañamos después de tu compra.</small></p></div>
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><p><strong>Despacho rápido</strong><small>Mismo día antes de las 13 h; después, dentro de las 24 h.</small></p></div>
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><p><strong>10 días para devolverlo</strong><small>Desde la compra, con el producto completo y en perfecto estado.</small></p></div>
      <div><span aria-hidden="true">04</span><p><strong>Envío y pago claros</strong><small>Costos y medios de pago visibles antes de confirmar.</small></p></div>
    </section>

    <div class="premium-faq">
      <div class="premium-section-heading">
        <p class="premium-eyebrow"><span></span> ANTES DE ELEGIR</p>
        <h2 id="PremiumFaq-{{ section.id }}">Preguntas <em>frecuentes.</em></h2>
        <p>Todo lo que necesitás saber sobre el producto y tu compra.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="premium-faq-list">
        {% if is_reading_stand %}
          <details><summary>¿Puedo usarlo con laptop, libros o tabletas?</summary><p>Sí. El atril está pensado para sostener laptop, libros y tabletas, y su rotación de 360° permite ajustar la orientación.</p></details>
          <details><summary>¿Se puede plegar y guardar?</summary><p>Sí. Su diseño portátil se pliega para facilitar el guardado y el traslado.</p></details>
          <details><summary>¿Qué espacio ocupa?</summary><p>Sus dimensiones son 340 × 235 × 76 mm. Incluye una ranura para tener pequeños accesorios a mano.</p></details>
          <details><summary>¿De qué material está hecho?</summary><p>La estructura está fabricada en MDF.</p></details>
        {% elsif is_orthopedic_cushion %}
          <details><summary>¿Qué medidas tiene?</summary><p>Mide 48 × 38 × 12 cm. Antes de comprar, verificá que el asiento de tu silla o de tu auto tenga al menos ese ancho y esa profundidad.</p></details>
          <details><summary>¿Cómo se limpia?</summary><p>La funda es extraíble, así podés retirarla y lavarla por separado. Recomendamos no mojar el núcleo de espuma viscoelástica.</p></details>
          <details><summary>¿Cuánto tarda en recuperar su forma?</summary><p>La espuma viscoelástica es de recuperación lenta: vuelve a su forma original en 3 a 5 segundos después de usarla.</p></details>
          <details><summary>¿En qué colores está disponible?</summary><p>En gris y en azul marino. Elegí el color antes de agregarlo al carrito.</p></details>
        {% endif %}
        <details><summary>¿Cómo puedo comprar?</summary><p>Elegí el producto, agregalo al carrito y seguí los pasos del checkout para completar tus datos, elegir el envío y confirmar el pago.</p></details>
        <details><summary>¿Qué garantía tiene?</summary><p>Los productos cuentan con 60 días de garantía. Si necesitás asistencia, escribinos desde la <a href="/pages/contact">página de contacto</a> e incluí tu número de pedido y una descripción del inconveniente.</p></details>
        <details><summary>¿Puedo devolver mi compra?</summary><p>Podés solicitar la devolución dentro de los 10 días desde la compra para pedir el reintegro. El producto debe estar en perfectas condiciones y completo, sin faltantes. Contactanos para coordinar la devolución.</p></details>
        <details><summary>¿Cuándo se despacha mi pedido?</summary><p>Las compras realizadas antes de las 13:00 se despachan ese mismo día. Las compras realizadas después de ese horario se despachan dentro de las 24 horas. El plazo de entrega depende del destino y del operador logístico.</p></details>
        <details><summary>¿Cuánto cuesta y cuánto demora el envío?</summary><p>El costo y la estimación de entrega se calculan según tu destino y se muestran durante el checkout, antes de confirmar la compra.</p></details>
        <details><summary>¿Qué medios de pago puedo usar?</summary><p>En el checkout vas a ver los medios de pago disponibles para tu compra, junto con las opciones de cuotas cuando correspondan.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
    <section class="premium-reviews" aria-labelledby="PremiumReviewsTitle-{{ section.id }}">
      <div class="premium-section-heading">
        <p class="premium-eyebrow"><span></span> EXPERIENCIAS REALES</p>
        <h2 id="PremiumReviewsTitle-{{ section.id }}">Lo que dicen<br><em>quienes lo usan.</em></h2>
        <p>Opiniones de clientes que compraron este producto.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="premium-reviews-apps">
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          {% render block %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="premium-final-cta">
      <p class="premium-eyebrow"><span></span> NEKOVA · CONFORT DIARIO</p>
      <h2>Tu próxima hora sentado<br><em>puede ser más cómoda.</em></h2>
      <p>{% if has_discount %}Precio especial. Los costos de envío y las opciones de pago se confirman en el checkout.{% elsif is_k25_light %}Luz RGB portátil para tus proyectos creativos.{% elsif is_comfort_product %}60 días de garantía y despacho en el día para compras antes de las 13 h.{% else %}Diseño funcional para acompañar tu día.{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="premium-price premium-price-centered">
        <span class="premium-price-current">{{ current_price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} <small>ARS</small></span>
        {% if has_discount %}
          <span class="premium-price-was">{{ original_price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} ARS</span>
          <span class="premium-discount">{{ discount_percent }}% OFF</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {%- if featured_product != blank and featured_product.available and has_variant_choice -%}
        <a class="premium-buy-button" href="#PremiumVariants-{{ section.id }}">
          <span>Elegí tu {{ variant_option_name | downcase | escape }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
        </a>
      {%- elsif featured_product != blank and featured_product.available -%}
        {% form 'product', featured_product, class: 'premium-buy-form' %}
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ selected_variant.id }}">
          <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
          <button class="premium-buy-button" type="submit" name="add">
            <span>{% if is_k25_light %}Quiero mi lámpara{% elsif is_ergonomic_cushion or is_orthopedic_cushion %}Quiero mi cojín{% elsif is_reading_stand %}Quiero mi soporte{% else %}Quiero el mío{% endif %}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </button>
        {% endform %}
      {%- elsif featured_product != blank -%}
        <a class="premium-buy-button" href="#BackInStockEmail-{{ section.id }}">
          <span>Avisarme cuando esté disponible</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      <p class="premium-small-note">{{ featured_product.vendor }}{% if is_reading_stand %} · MDF · Giratorio 360° · Ajustable y portátil{% elsif is_ergonomic_cushion %} · Doble capa · Funda extraíble{% elsif is_orthopedic_cushion %} · Espuma viscoelástica · Ranura en U · Funda extraíble{% endif %}</p>
      <p class="premium-contact-note">¿Tenés dudas? <a href="/pages/contact">Escribinos</a> y te ayudamos a elegir.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% style %}
  .premium-landing {
    --premium-bg: var(--nekova-bg);
    --premium-surface: var(--nekova-surface);
    --premium-panel: var(--nekova-panel);
    --premium-ink: var(--nekova-ink);
    --premium-muted: var(--nekova-muted);
    --premium-accent: var(--nekova-accent);
    --premium-accent-strong: var(--nekova-accent-strong);
    --premium-accent-soft: var(--nekova-accent-soft);
    --premium-line: var(--nekova-line);
    background: var(--premium-bg);
    color: var(--premium-ink);
    font-family: var(--nekova-font-body);
    padding: 0 0 8rem;
  }
  .premium-landing * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .premium-shell { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1360px; padding: 0 5%; }
  .premium-hero { align-items: center; display: grid; gap: 6%; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; padding: 5rem 0 7rem; }
  .premium-copy { max-width: 52rem; padding: 1rem 0; }
  .premium-copy .premium-edition { margin-top: 3rem; }
  .premium-copy h1, .premium-story h2, .premium-section-heading h2, .premium-specs h2, .premium-packaging h2, .premium-final-cta h2 {
    color: var(--premium-ink); font-family: var(--nekova-font-heading); font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 4.4vw, 5.2rem);
    font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 1.6rem 0 1.2rem;
  }
  .premium-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 5.2vw, 6.4rem); }
  .premium-copy h1 em, .premium-story h2 em, .premium-section-heading h2 em, .premium-specs h2 em, .premium-packaging h2 em, .premium-final-cta h2 em { color: var(--premium-accent); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; }
  .premium-product-title { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; margin: 0 0 .4rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .premium-product-name { color: var(--premium-ink); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 2rem 0 .8rem; }
  .premium-intro, .premium-story-copy > p:not(.premium-eyebrow), .premium-specs-intro > p:not(.premium-eyebrow), .premium-packaging > div:first-child > p:not(.premium-eyebrow) {
    color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 48rem;
  }
  .premium-price { align-items: center; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8rem 1.2rem; margin: 2.4rem 0 .7rem; }
  .premium-price-current { color: var(--premium-ink); font-family: var(--nekova-font-heading); font-size: 3rem; }
  .premium-price-current small { color: var(--premium-muted); font: 600 1.1rem var(--nekova-font-body); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .premium-price-was { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.4rem; text-decoration: line-through; }
  .premium-discount { background: var(--nekova-warm-soft); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-pill); color: var(--premium-ink); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; padding: .5rem 1.2rem; }
  .premium-launch-note, .premium-select-note { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .premium-buy-form { margin: 2.4rem 0 0; }
  .premium-buy-button { align-items: center; background: var(--premium-accent); border: 0; border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-pill); box-shadow: 0 .8rem 2rem rgba(var(--nekova-ink-rgb), .12); color: var(--nekova-on-accent); cursor: pointer; display: flex; font: 700 1.5rem var(--nekova-font-body); justify-content: space-between; letter-spacing: .02em; max-width: 44rem; min-height: 5.6rem; padding: 0 2.6rem; text-decoration: none; transition: background .2s, transform .2s; width: 100%; }
  .premium-buy-button:hover { background: var(--premium-accent-strong); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .premium-buy-button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--premium-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .premium-buy-button:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .55; }
  .premium-stock-notice { background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); margin-top: 2.2rem; max-width: 48rem; padding: 2.2rem; }
  .premium-stock-status { color: var(--premium-accent); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .premium-stock-notice > p { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .premium-stock-form > label:first-of-type { color: var(--premium-ink); display: block; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .premium-stock-input-row { display: flex; gap: .8rem; }
  .premium-stock-input-row input { background: var(--premium-bg); border: 1px solid var(--nekova-line-strong); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-pill); color: var(--premium-ink); flex: 1; font: inherit; min-width: 0; padding: 1.2rem 1.6rem; }
  .premium-stock-submit { background: var(--premium-accent); border: 0; border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-pill); color: var(--nekova-on-accent); cursor: pointer; font: 700 1.4rem var(--nekova-font-body); padding: 0 2rem; }
  .premium-stock-consent { align-items: flex-start; color: var(--premium-muted); display: flex; font-size: 1.25rem; gap: .8rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .premium-stock-consent input { accent-color: var(--premium-accent); margin-top: .2rem; }
  .premium-stock-success { color: var(--premium-accent); line-height: 1.7; }
  .premium-stock-error { color: var(--nekova-error); line-height: 1.7; }
  .premium-assurances { color: var(--premium-muted); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 1.3rem; gap: .6rem 1.8rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .premium-assurances span::before { color: var(--premium-accent); content: '✓'; font-weight: 700; margin-right: .6rem; }
  .premium-policy-note { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; max-width: 48rem; }
  .premium-policy-note a, .premium-faq-list a, .premium-contact-note a { color: var(--premium-accent); text-underline-offset: .2em; }
  .premium-variant-picker { border: 0; margin: 0 0 1.8rem; min-width: 0; padding: 0; }
  .premium-variant-picker legend { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: .16em; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .premium-variant-picker legend > span { color: var(--premium-ink); }
  .premium-variant-options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8rem; }
  .premium-variant-picker--swatches .premium-variant-options { gap: 1.2rem; padding-top: .4rem; }
  .premium-variant-option { cursor: pointer; position: relative; }
  .premium-variant-option input { height: 1px; margin: 0; opacity: 0; position: absolute; width: 1px; }
  .premium-variant-pill { align-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--premium-ink); display: inline-flex; font-size: 1.3rem; min-height: 4.2rem; padding: .8rem 1.6rem; transition: background .2s, border-color .2s, color .2s; }
  .premium-variant-option:hover .premium-variant-pill { border-color: var(--premium-accent); }
  .premium-variant-option input:checked + .premium-variant-pill { background: var(--premium-ink); border-color: var(--premium-ink); color: var(--premium-bg); }
  .premium-variant-swatch { background-position: center; background-size: cover; border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--premium-bg), 0 0 0 4px transparent; display: block; height: 3.6rem; transition: box-shadow .2s; width: 3.6rem; }
  .premium-variant-option:hover .premium-variant-swatch { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--premium-bg), 0 0 0 4px var(--premium-accent); }
  .premium-variant-option input:checked + .premium-variant-swatch { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--premium-bg), 0 0 0 4px var(--premium-ink); }
  .premium-variant-tooltip { background: var(--premium-ink); bottom: calc(100% + 1rem); color: var(--premium-bg); font-size: 1.2rem; left: 50%; letter-spacing: .04em; opacity: 0; padding: .5rem 1rem; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; transform: translate(-50%, .4rem); transition: opacity .15s, transform .15s; white-space: nowrap; z-index: 2; }
  .premium-variant-tooltip::after { border: .5rem solid transparent; border-top-color: var(--premium-ink); content: ''; left: 50%; position: absolute; top: 100%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .premium-variant-option:hover .premium-variant-tooltip, .premium-variant-option input:focus-visible ~ .premium-variant-tooltip { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }
  .premium-variant-option input:focus-visible + span { outline: 2px solid var(--premium-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .premium-variant-option input:focus-visible + .premium-variant-swatch { outline-offset: 6px; }
  .premium-variant-option input:disabled + span { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .45; }
  .premium-variant-option input:disabled + .premium-variant-pill { text-decoration: line-through; }
  .premium-variant-option input:disabled + .premium-variant-swatch { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 47%, var(--premium-muted) 47%, var(--premium-muted) 53%, transparent 53%); }
  .premium-gallery { min-width: 0; }
  .premium-gallery-main { aspect-ratio: 1; background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--nekova-shadow); overflow: hidden; position: relative; touch-action: pan-y; }
  .premium-gallery-open { background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: zoom-in; display: block; height: 100%; inset: 0; padding: 0; position: absolute; width: 100%; }
  .premium-gallery-main img { display: block; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; padding: 4%; width: 100%; }
  .premium-gallery-control { align-items: center; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 .4rem 1.2rem rgba(var(--nekova-ink-rgb), .1); color: var(--premium-ink); cursor: pointer; display: flex; height: 4.4rem; justify-content: center; padding: 0; position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); transition: background .2s, color .2s; width: 4.4rem; z-index: 2; }
  .premium-gallery-control:hover { background: var(--premium-accent); color: var(--nekova-on-accent); }
  .premium-gallery-control:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--premium-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .premium-gallery-control span { font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1; }
  .premium-gallery-previous { left: 1.4rem; }
  .premium-gallery-next { right: 1.4rem; }
  .premium-image-index { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-pill); bottom: 1.4rem; color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; padding: .6rem 1.2rem; position: absolute; right: 1.4rem; }
  .premium-gallery-thumbs { display: grid; gap: .8rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin-top: 1rem; }
  .premium-gallery-thumbs button { aspect-ratio: 1; background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-sm); cursor: pointer; opacity: .7; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; transition: border-color .2s, opacity .2s; }
  .premium-gallery-thumbs button.is-active, .premium-gallery-thumbs button:hover { border-color: var(--premium-accent); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--premium-accent); opacity: 1; }
  .premium-gallery-thumbs img { height: 100%; object-fit: contain; width: 100%; }
  .premium-copy, .premium-story > *, .premium-benefit-grid > *, .premium-specs > *, .premium-faq > *, .premium-reviews > * { min-width: 0; }
  .premium-landing .rte { max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .premium-landing .rte img, .premium-landing .rte video, .premium-landing .rte iframe { max-width: 100%; }
  .premium-landing .rte table { display: block; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }
  .premium-lightbox { background: rgba(var(--nekova-bg-rgb), .98); border: 0; color: var(--premium-ink); height: 100dvh; margin: 0; max-height: none; max-width: none; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; position: fixed; width: 100vw; }
  .premium-lightbox[open] { align-items: center; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .premium-lightbox::backdrop { background: rgba(var(--nekova-bg-rgb), .98); }
  .premium-lightbox-content { align-items: center; display: flex; height: 100%; justify-content: center; position: relative; touch-action: pan-y; width: 100%; }
  .premium-lightbox-image { background: var(--premium-surface); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); display: block; height: calc(100dvh - 8rem); max-height: calc(100dvh - 8rem); max-width: calc(100vw - 12rem); object-fit: contain; touch-action: pan-y; width: auto; }
  .premium-lightbox-close { align-items: center; background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--premium-ink); cursor: pointer; display: flex; font-size: 3rem; height: 4.8rem; justify-content: center; line-height: 1; padding: 0 0 .3rem; position: absolute; right: 2.4rem; top: 2.4rem; width: 4.8rem; z-index: 3; }
  .premium-lightbox-previous { left: 2.4rem; }
  .premium-lightbox-next { right: 2.4rem; }
  .premium-lightbox-caption { bottom: 1rem; color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.3rem; left: 7rem; margin: 0; position: absolute; right: 7rem; text-align: center; }
  .premium-marquee { align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-top: 1px solid var(--premium-line); color: var(--premium-muted); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 1.2rem; gap: 1.4rem; justify-content: space-around; letter-spacing: .2em; padding: 2.1rem 0; }
  .premium-marquee i { background: var(--premium-accent); border-radius: 50%; height: .45rem; width: .45rem; }
  .premium-section-heading { margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .premium-section-heading h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .premium-section-heading > p:last-child:not(.premium-eyebrow) { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 46rem; }
  .premium-needs { padding: 2rem 0 8rem; }
  .premium-needs-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.6rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .premium-needs-grid article, .premium-benefit-grid article { background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); padding: 2.8rem; }
  .premium-benefit-number { align-items: center; background: var(--premium-accent-soft); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--premium-accent-strong); display: inline-flex; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; height: 3.6rem; justify-content: center; width: 3.6rem; }
  .premium-needs-grid h3, .premium-benefit-grid h3 { color: var(--premium-ink); font-family: var(--nekova-font-heading); font-size: 2.1rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; margin: 2.2rem 0 .8rem; }
  .premium-needs-grid p, .premium-benefit-grid p { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
  .premium-story { align-items: center; background: var(--premium-panel); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); display: grid; gap: 7%; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding: 5rem; }
  .premium-story-image { aspect-ratio: 1; background: var(--premium-surface); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); overflow: hidden; }
  .premium-story-image img { display: block; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; width: 100%; }
  .premium-story-copy a { color: var(--premium-accent); display: inline-block; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1.6rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .premium-photo-story { display: grid; gap: 1.6rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1120px; padding: 6rem 0; }
  .premium-photo-story figure { background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .premium-photo-story img { aspect-ratio: 1; display: block; height: auto; object-fit: contain; width: 100%; }
  .premium-photo-story figcaption { border-top: 1px solid var(--premium-line); color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.5; padding: 1.4rem 2rem; }
  .premium-video { align-items: center; background: var(--premium-accent-soft); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); display: grid; gap: 6%; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; padding: 5rem; }
  .premium-video .premium-section-heading { margin: 0; }
  .premium-video video { background: var(--premium-surface); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); display: block; max-height: 75vh; width: 100%; }
  .premium-generic-description { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .premium-benefits { padding: 8rem 0 4rem; }
  .premium-benefit-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.6rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .premium-specs { background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); display: grid; gap: 8%; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1fr; margin: 4rem 0; padding: 5rem; }
  .premium-specs-intro > p:not(.premium-eyebrow) { max-width: 34rem; }
  .premium-spec-list { margin: 0; }
  .premium-spec-list div { align-items: baseline; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--premium-line); display: flex; gap: 2rem; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1.4rem 0; }
  .premium-spec-list div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .premium-spec-list dt { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .premium-spec-list dd { color: var(--premium-ink); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; text-align: right; }
  .premium-packaging { align-items: center; display: grid; gap: 8%; grid-template-columns: 1fr .65fr; padding: 8rem 0; }
  .premium-packaging ul { border-left: 2px solid var(--premium-accent-soft); color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 2.8; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding-left: 2.5rem; }
  .premium-trust { display: grid; gap: 1.6rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 4rem 0; }
  .premium-trust > div { align-items: flex-start; background: var(--premium-accent-soft); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; padding: 2.4rem 2rem; }
  .premium-trust > div > span { color: var(--premium-accent-strong); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; padding-top: .3rem; }
  .premium-trust p { margin: 0; }
  .premium-trust strong, .premium-trust small { display: block; }
  .premium-trust strong { color: var(--premium-ink); font: 400 1.8rem/1.3 var(--nekova-font-heading); }
  .premium-trust small { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: .6rem; }
  .premium-faq { display: grid; gap: 8%; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; padding: 6rem 0; }
  .premium-faq .premium-section-heading { margin: 0; }
  .premium-faq-list details { background: var(--premium-surface); border: 1px solid var(--premium-line); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 0 2.2rem; }
  .premium-faq-list summary { color: var(--premium-ink); cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; list-style: none; padding: 1.9rem 3.6rem 1.9rem 0; position: relative; }
  .premium-faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .premium-faq-list summary::after { align-items: center; background: var(--premium-accent-soft); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--premium-accent-strong); content: '+'; display: flex; font-size: 1.8rem; height: 2.8rem; justify-content: center; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 2.8rem; }
  .premium-faq-list details[open] summary::after { content: '−'; }
  .premium-faq-list summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--premium-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .premium-faq-list details p { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 2rem; max-width: 60rem; }
  .premium-reviews { display: grid; gap: 8%; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; padding: 6rem 0; }
  .premium-reviews .premium-section-heading { align-self: center; margin: 0; }
  .premium-reviews-apps { align-self: center; }
  .premium-final-cta { --premium-ink: var(--nekova-on-accent); --premium-muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82); --premium-accent: var(--nekova-accent-soft); background: var(--nekova-accent); border-radius: var(--nekova-radius-lg); color: var(--premium-ink); margin-top: 4rem; padding: 7rem 2rem; text-align: center; }
  .premium-final-cta .premium-eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .premium-final-cta h2 { font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 5vw, 6rem); }
  .premium-final-cta > p:not(.premium-eyebrow) { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .premium-price-centered { justify-content: center; }
  .premium-final-cta .premium-discount { color: var(--nekova-ink); }
  .premium-final-cta .premium-buy-button { background: var(--nekova-surface); color: var(--nekova-accent-strong); margin: 2.4rem auto 0; text-align: left; }
  .premium-final-cta .premium-buy-button:hover { background: var(--nekova-accent-soft); }
  .premium-final-cta .premium-buy-button:focus-visible { outline-color: var(--nekova-surface); }
  .premium-small-note { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .premium-contact-note { color: var(--premium-muted); font-size: 1.4rem; margin: .8rem 0 0; }
  .premium-final-cta .premium-contact-note a { color: var(--nekova-on-accent); }
  @media screen and (max-width: 990px) {
    .premium-shell { padding: 0 2.2rem; }
    .premium-hero { gap: 4rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 3rem 0 5rem; }
    .premium-copy { max-width: 70rem; }
    .premium-gallery { order: -1; }
    .premium-gallery-thumbs { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .premium-needs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .premium-story { gap: 4rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 3.2rem; }
    .premium-story-image { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 48rem; width: 100%; }
    .premium-benefit-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .premium-specs { gap: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 3.2rem; }
    .premium-packaging { gap: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr .65fr; }
    .premium-trust { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .premium-faq, .premium-reviews, .premium-video { gap: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .premium-video { padding: 3.2rem; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    .premium-shell { padding: 0 1.6rem; }
    .premium-landing { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
    .premium-hero { padding: 1.6rem 0 4rem; }
    .premium-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 11vw, 4.6rem); }
    .premium-product-name { font-size: 1.7rem; }
    .premium-intro { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .premium-gallery-main { border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); }
    .premium-gallery-control { height: 3.8rem; width: 3.8rem; }
    .premium-gallery-previous { left: .8rem; }
    .premium-gallery-next { right: .8rem; }
    .premium-gallery-thumbs { gap: .6rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .premium-buy-button { max-width: none; }
    .premium-lightbox-image { border-radius: var(--nekova-radius); height: auto; max-height: calc(100dvh - 9rem); max-width: calc(100vw - 2rem); }
    .premium-lightbox-close { right: 1rem; top: 1rem; }
    .premium-lightbox-previous { left: .6rem; }
    .premium-lightbox-next { right: .6rem; }
    .premium-lightbox-caption { bottom: .8rem; font-size: 1.2rem; left: 2rem; right: 2rem; }
    .premium-copy h1, .premium-story h2, .premium-section-heading h2, .premium-specs h2, .premium-packaging h2 { font-size: 3.4rem; }
    .premium-needs { padding-bottom: 5rem; }
    .premium-needs-grid article, .premium-benefit-grid article { padding: 2.2rem; }
    .premium-story { padding: 2.2rem; }
    .premium-photo-story { gap: 1.2rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 4rem 0; }
    .premium-video { padding: 2.2rem; }
    .premium-benefits { padding-top: 5rem; }
    .premium-benefit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .premium-specs { padding: 2.2rem; }
    .premium-spec-list div { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .4rem; }
    .premium-spec-list dt, .premium-spec-list dd { max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-align: left; }
    .premium-packaging { gap: 2.5rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 5rem 0; }
    .premium-trust { gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .premium-faq, .premium-reviews { padding: 4rem 0; }
    .premium-faq-list details { padding: 0 1.6rem; }
    .premium-faq-list summary { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .premium-final-cta { padding: 5rem 1.8rem; }
    .premium-final-cta h2 { font-size: 3.4rem; }
    .premium-stock-input-row { flex-direction: column; }
    .premium-stock-submit { min-height: 4.8rem; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Nekova · producto destacado",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "premium-product-landing-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "Producto para agregar al carrito"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "launch_heading",
      "label": "Título de lanzamiento",
      "info": "Opcional. Reemplaza el nombre del producto como título principal (ideal para la página de inicio). Usá cursiva para la frase destacada."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Título principal",
      "default": "Leé, trabajá y creá desde otro ángulo."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Descripción breve",
      "default": "Un soporte de madera versátil, ajustable y giratorio para laptop, libros y tabletas."
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@app"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Nekova · producto destacado"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
